cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MaskLayer in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MaskLayer: Context-Preserving PII Masking for Turkish Documents"
authors:
  - family-names: "Şıkdiken"
    given-names: "Yavuz"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ysdiken/MaskLayer"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.6.1"
date-released: "2026-10-01"
abstract: >-
  MaskLayer replaces personal and financial data in Turkish documents with
  consistent placeholders, combining checksum-validated regular expressions,
  a fine-tuned BERTurk-based NER model and a gazetteer, so that sensitive
  documents can be processed by LLMs without the original values leaving
  the organisation's infrastructure.
keywords:
  - PII
  - anonymization
  - data masking
  - named entity recognition
  - Turkish NLP
  - KVKK
  - LLM
